  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining Data Structures**\n\nI\'m currently focused on defining the data structures for the news articles. I\'ve started with `src/types/index.ts` and outlined the `NewsArticle` interface. It includes fields like `id`, `title`, and `summary`, with an optional `content` field. I\'m also including a nested `source` object with `name`, and optional `url` and `domain` properties.\n\n\n**Expanding Data Structures**\n\nNow, I\'m fleshing out the `NewsArticle` interface further. I\'ve added fields for `url`, `imageUrl`, `publishedAt`, and a `category` string with specific options. I\'m also adding `market`, related tickers, and optional fields like `sentiment`, `isFeatured`, and `readTimeMinutes`. I\'m also thinking through `MarketIndex`, `FilterState` and `TrendingTopic` structures.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_114628"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"Append\":false, \"CodeContent\":\"export type MarketRegion = \'India\' | \'US\' | \'Global\';\\n\\nexport type NewsCategory =\\n  | \'All News\'\\n  | \'Indian Markets\'\\n  | \'Global Markets\'\\n  | \'Stocks & Companies\'\\n  | \'Economy\'\\n  | \'Earnings\'\\n  | \'IPOs\'\\n  | \'Commodities\'\\n  | \'Technology\';\\n\\nexport interface RelatedTicker {\\n  symbol: string;\\n  name: string;\\n  exchange?: string;\\n  changePercent?: number;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface NewsArticle {\\n  id: string;\\n  title: string;\\n  summary: string;\\n  content?: string;\\n  source: {\\n    name: string;\\n    url?: string;\\n    domain?: string;\\n  };\\n  url: string;\\n  imageUrl?: string;\\n  publishedAt: string;\\n  category: NewsCategory;\\n  market: MarketRegion;\\n  relatedTickers: RelatedTicker[];\\n  sentiment?: \'bullish\' | \'bearish\' | \'neutral\';\\n  isFeatured?: boolean;\\n  readTimeMinutes?: number;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface MarketIndex {\\n  symbol: string;\\n  name: string;\\n  value: number;\\n  change: number;\\n  changePercent: number;\\n  isPositive: boolean;\\n  region: \'India\' | \'US\';\\n  isDemo: boolean;\\n  lastUpdated: string;\\n  currency: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface FilterState {\\n  category: NewsCategory;\\n  market: \'All\' | MarketRegion;\\n  timeRange: \'all\' | \'today\' | \'week\';\\n  sortBy: \'recent\' | \'relevance\';\\n  searchQuery: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface MentionedCompany {\\n  symbol: string;\\n  name: string;\\n  exchange?: string;\\n  mentions: number;\\n  changePercent?: number;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface TrendingTopic {\\n  tag: string;\\n  count: number;\\n  category: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface NewsApiResponse {\\n  articles: NewsArticle[];\\n  isDemoData: boolean;\\n  sourceType: \'live_api\' | \'rss_live\' | \'curated_demo\';\\n  sourceName?: string;\\n  lastUpdated: string;\\n  totalCount: number;\\n  error?: string;\\n}\\n\", \"Description\":\"Define core domain types for St