  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing UI Components**\n\nI\'m now diving into building the UI components, specifically focusing on the `Sidebar.tsx` file. I\'ve integrated the StockSense logo, wordmark, and tagline. I have begun implementing the links: Market Overview, which will be \"Coming Soon\", and Stock News, which is currently active and highlighted in electric blue (#3B82F6).\n\n\n**Building Topbar & Ticker**\n\nI\'ve made headway on the `Topbar.tsx` now. I\'ve got the hamburger toggle sorted for mobile and incorporated a search input. The keyboard shortcut tooltip is functional. I\'m also working on a market status indicator. I\'m focusing on the date formatting and refresh news button state too. After that I plan to work on the user profile avatar and research badge. Parallel to that, the market ticker is progressing nicely, showing 6 indices. I\'ve handled the formatting of values and indicators, and added a demo feed chip.\n\n\n**Designing News Layouts**\n\nI\'m now deep in designing the news layouts. I have begun work on `FeaturedNews.tsx` for the hero card, considering elements such as images, badges, headlines, and publisher information. Next up is `NewsCard.tsx`, where I\'m aiming for a compact and dense card, including ticker chips with change percentages and sentiment pills. Following that, I\'m thinking about the layout options in `NewsFeed.tsx`.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_215235"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"Append\":false, \"CodeContent\":\"import React from \'react\';\\nimport {\\n  Newspaper,\\n  TrendingUp,\\n  Building2,\\n  Bookmark,\\n  Briefcase,\\n  Settings,\\n  ChevronLeft,\\n  ChevronRight,\\n  ShieldCheck,\\n  X,\\n} from \'lucide-react\';\\n\\ninterface SidebarProps {\\n  isCollapsed: boolean;\\n  onToggleCollapse: () => void;\\n  isOpenMobile: boolean;\\n  onCloseMobile: () => void;\\n  onOpenSettings: () => void;\\n  activeNav: string;\\n  setActiveNav: (nav: string) => void;\\n}\\n\\nexport const Sidebar: React.FC<SidebarProps> = ({\\n  isCollapsed,\\n  onToggleCollapse,\\n  isOpenMobile,\\n  onCloseMobile,\\n  onOpenSettings,\\n  activeNav,\\n  setActiveNav,\\n}) => {\\n  const navItems = [\\n    { id: \'news\', label: \'Stock News\', icon: Newspaper, isReady: true },\\n    { id: \'overview\', label: \'Market Overview\', icon: TrendingUp, isReady: false },\\n    { id: \'research\', label: \'Company Research\', icon: Building2, isReady: false },\\n    { id: \'watchlist\', label: \'Watchlist\', icon: Bookmark, isReady: false },\\n    { id: \'paper_trading\', label: \'Paper Trading\', icon: Briefcase, isReady: false },\\n  ];\\n\\n  const handleNavClick = (id: string, isReady: boolean) => {\\n    if (isReady) {\\n      setActiveNav(id);\\n      onCloseMobile();\\n    }\\n  };\\n\\n  return (\\n    <>\\n      {/* Mobile Backdrop */}\\n      {isOpenMobile && (\\n        <div\\n          role=\\\"button\\\"\\n          tabIndex={0}\\n          aria-label=\\\"Close mobile navigation backdrop\\\"\\n          onClick={onCloseMobile}\\n          onKeyDown={(e) => {\\n            if (e.key === \'Enter\' || e.key === \' \') {\\n              onCloseMobile();\\n            }\\n          }}\\n          className=\\\"fixed inset-0 bg-black/70 backdrop-blur-xs z-40 lg:hidden cursor-pointer\\\"\\n        />\\n      )}\\n\\n      {/* Sidebar Container */}\\n      <aside\\n        className={`fixed top-0 bottom-0 left-0 z-50 flex flex-col bg-[#0b0f14] border-r border-[#1e293b] transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out ${\\n          isOpenMobile ? \'translate-x-0 w-72\' : \'-translate-x-full lg:translate-x-0\'\\n        } ${isCollapsed ? \'lg:w-20\' : \'lg:w-64\'}`}\\n      >\\n        {/* Brand Header */}\\n        <div className=\\\"h-16 flex items-center justify-between px-4 border-b border-[#1e293b]\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"flex items-center space-x-3 overflow-hidden\\\">\\n            <div className=\\\"w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-blue-600/20 border border-blue-500/40 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 text-blue-400\\\">\\n              <svg className=\\\"w-5 h-5 fill-current\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\">\\n                <path d=\\\"M3 13h2v-2H3v2zm0 4h2v-2H3v2zm0-8h2V7H3v2zm4 4h14v-2H7v2zm0 4h14v-2H7v2zM7 7v2h14V7H7z\\\" />\\n              </svg>\\n            </div>\\n            {!isCollapsed && (\\n              <div className=\\\"flex flex-col\\\">\\n                <span className=\\\"font-bold tracking-tight text-white text-lg leading-tight\\\">\\n                  Stock<span className=\\\"text-blue-400\\\">Sense</span>\\n                </span>\\n                <span className=\\\"text-[10px] text-slate-400 tracking-wider uppercase font-medium\\\">\\n                  Terminal v1.0\\n                </span>\\n              </div>\\n            )}\\n          </div>\\n\\n          {/* Mobile close button */}\\n          <button\\n            onClick={onCloseMobile}\\n            className=\\\"lg:hidden p-1.5 rounded-md text-slate-400 hover:text-white hover:bg-[#121821]\\\"\\n            aria-label=\\\"Close menu\\\"\\n          >\\n            <X className=\\\"w-5 h-5\\\" />\\n          </button>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* Navigation Items */}\\n        <nav className=\\\"flex-1 py-4 px-3 space-y-1.5 overflow-y-auto\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"px-3 pb-2 text-[10px] font-semibold text-slate-300 uppercase tracking-wider\\\">\\n            {!isCollapsed ? \'Research & Markets\' : \'\342\200\242\342\200\242\342\200\242\'}\\n          </div>\\n\\n          {navItems.map((item) => {\\n            const Icon = item.icon;\\n            const isActive = activeNav === item.id;\\n            return (\\n              <button\\n                key={item.id}\\n                onClick={() => handleNavClick(item.id, item.isReady)}\\n                title={isCollapsed ? item.label : undefined}\\n                className={`w-full flex items-center rounded-lg px-3 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium transition-all group relative ${\\n                  isActive\\n                    ? \'bg-blue-600/15 text-blue-400 border border-blue-500/30 font-semibold\'\\n                    : item.isReady\\n                    ? \'text-slate-300 hover:text-white hover:bg-[#121821]\'\\n                    : \'text-slate-300 cursor-not-allowed hover:bg-[#121821]/40\'\\n                } ${isCollapsed ? \'justify-center\' : \'justify-between\'}`}\\n              >\\n                <div className=\\\"flex items-center space-x-3\\\">\\n                  <Icon\\n                    className={`w-5 h-5 shrink-0 ${\\n                      isActive ? \'text-blue-400\' : \'text-slate-400 group-hover:text-slate-200\'\\n                    }`}\\n                  />\\n                  {!isCollapsed && <span>{item.label}</span>}\\n                </div>\\n\\n                {!isCollapsed && !item.isReady && (\\n                  <span className=\\\"text-[10px] uppercase font-mono px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-800 text-slate-400 border border-slate-700/60\\\">\\n                    Soon\\n                  </span>\\n                )}\\n              </button>\\n            );\\n          })}\\n        </nav>\\n\\n        {/* Bottom Area: Settings & Collapse Toggle */}\\n        <div className=\\\"p-3 border-t border-[#1e293b] space-y-2\\\">\\n          <button\\n            onClick={onOpenSettings}\\n            title={isCollapsed ? \'Settings & Data Provider\' : undefined}\\n            className={`w-full flex items-center rounded-lg px-3 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium text-slate-300 hover:text-white hover:bg-[#121821] transition-all group ${\\n              isCollapsed ? \'justify-center\' : \'space-x-3\'\\n            }`}\\n          >\\n            <Settings className=\\\"w-5 h-5 text-slate-400 group-hover:text-slate-200 shrink-0\\\" />\\n            {!isCollapsed && <span>Settings & API</span>}\\n          </button>\\n\\n          {!isCollapsed && (\\n            <div className=\\\"px-3 py-2 rounded-lg bg-[#121821] border border-[#1e293b] text-xs\\\">\\n              <div className=\\\"flex items-center space-x-1.5 text-emerald-400 font-medium\\\">\\n                <ShieldCheck className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />\\n                <span>Protected Sandbox</span>\\n              </div>\\n              <p className=\\\"text-[11px] text-slate-400 mt-1\\\">\\n                Zero client API exposure. Pure financial terminal mode.\\n              </p>\\n            </div>\\n          )}\\n\\n          {/* Desktop Collapse Button */}\\n          <button\\n            onClick={onToggleCollapse}\\n            className=\\\"hidden lg:flex w-full items-center justify-center p-2 rounded-lg text-slate-400 hover:text-white hover:bg-[#121821] transition-colors\\\"\\n            aria-label={isCollapsed ? \'Expand sidebar\' : \'Collapse sidebar\'}\\n          >\\n            {isCollapsed ? (\\n              <ChevronRight className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />\\n            ) : (\\n              <div className=\\\"flex items-center space-x-2 text-xs text-slate-400\\\">\\n                <ChevronLeft className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />\\n                <span>Collapse Sidebar</span>\\n              </div>\\n            )}\\n          </button>\\n        </div>\\n      </aside>\\n    </>\\n  );\\n};\\n\", \"Description\":\"Collapsible responsive sidebar with StockSense brand and Coming Soon pages\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/Sidebar.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Writing Sidebar component\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create Sidebar component\"}"
