    thinking: "**Constructing Trending Panel**\n\nI\'m now diving into building the `TrendingPanel.tsx` component. The aim is to create a right-side panel for desktop displays. I\'m focusing on incorporating trending stories, lists of the most mentioned companies, and popular market topics as elements of this panel. I\'m considering the best data structures and API calls.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
