    response: "### StockSense \342\200\224 Financial Research & News Terminal\n\n**StockSense** has been built as a high-density financial research and news platform with a dark-first terminal aesthetic (`#0B0F14` background, `#121821` cards, `#3B82F6` electric blue accents, muted green/red movement indicators).\n\n---\n\n### What Was Built & Verified\n\n1. **Architecture & Server-Side Security**:\n   - **Express + Vite Full-Stack Server** (`server.ts`): Secure backend API routes (`/api/news`, `/api/market-indices`, `/api/status`) preventing API key exposure to client code.\n   - **Provider Abstraction & Fallback**: Integrates Finnhub and NewsAPI when environment keys (`FINNHUB_API_KEY`, `NEWS_API_KEY`) are present, with automatic fallback to a curated, high-fidelity research dataset. Clearly labeled with a **Demo News** indicator to avoid claiming simulated prices/stories are real-time.\n   - **Performance & Resiliency**: Built-in 2-minute server-side caching, request timeouts, and error handling.\n\n2. **Dashboard Layout & Navigation**:\n   - **Sidebar Navigation**: StockSense brand badge, active **Stock News** module, honest **Coming Soon** views (Market Overview, Company Research, Watchlist, Paper Trading) with roadmap disclosures, and collapsible desktop & mobile drawer states.\n   - **Topbar**: Live global search input with shortcut (`/`), market status pulse, current date, and refresh action.\n   - **Market Ticker Strip**: Horizontally scrollable strip displaying **NIFTY 50**, **SENSEX**, **BANK NIFTY**, **S&P 500**, **NASDAQ Composite**, and **Dow Jones** with absolute points, percentage changes, movement indicators, smooth scroll controls, and clear **DEMO** badges.\n\n3. **Stock News Dashboard**:\n   - **Category Filters**: All News, Indian Markets, Global Markets, Stocks & Companies, Economy, Earnings, IPOs, Commodities, and Technology.\n   - **Secondary Controls**: Region filter (India, US, Global), Time Range (All, Today, This Week), and Sorting (Most Recent, Relevance).\n   - **Featured Story**: Hero card highlighting top stories with custom fallback financial terminal graphics.\n   - **News Feed**: Compact, high-density cards with publisher names, relative timestamps, sentiment tags, ticker chips (clickable to filter), pagination, empty state reset, and loading skeletons.\n   - **Trending Intelligence Panel**: Data-derived company mentions (e.g. $RELIANCE, $NVDA, $ZOMATO), popular market themes (Q3 Earnings, RBI Policy, AI Infrastructure), and key stories.\n   - **Article Details**: Modal with publisher metadata, full fair-use summaries, related equities, copyable links, and direct external links to original publishers.\n   - **Settings & API Modal**: Step-by-step instructions for adding free API keys in `.env`.\n\n---\n\n### Verification Summary\n- **Unit Tests**: 7/7 tests passed via `node:test` (`src/utils/newsFilters.test.ts`), verifying article deduplication, multi-criteria filtering, search relevance ranking, trending company extraction, and relative time formatting.\n- **Visual & Interactive Browser Verification**: Inspected across desktop (1440\303\227900) and mobile (390\303\227844) viewports. Verified modal interactions, search filtering, and fallback terminal graphics for offline image reliability.\n- **Compilation & Linting**: Clean TypeScript build (`compile_applet` and `lint_applet` passed with zero errors)."
    modified_response: "### StockSense \342\200\224 Financial Research & News Terminal\n\n**StockSense** has been built as a high-density financial research and news platform with a dark-first terminal aesthetic (`#0B0F14` background, `#121821` cards, `#3B82F6` electric blue accents, muted green/red movement indicators).\n\n---\n\n### What Was Built & Verified\n\n1. **Architecture & Server-Side Security**:\n   - **Express + Vite Full-Stack Server** (`server.ts`): Secure backend API routes (`/api/news`, `/api/market-indices`, `/api/status`) preventing API key exposure to client code.\n   - **Provider Abstraction & Fallback**: Integrates Finnhub and NewsAPI when environment keys (`FINNHUB_API_KEY`, `NEWS_API_KEY`) are present, with automatic fallback to a curated, high-fidelity research dataset. Clearly labeled with a **Demo News** indicator to avoid claiming simulated prices/stories are real-time.\n   - **Performance & Resiliency**: Built-in 2-minute server-side caching, request timeouts, and error handling.\n\n2. **Dashboard Layout & Navigation**:\n   - **Sidebar Navigation**: StockSense brand badge, active **Stock News** module, honest **Coming Soon** views (Market Overview, Company Research, Watchlist, Paper Trading) with roadmap disclosures, and collapsible desktop & mobile drawer states.\n   - **Topbar**: Live global search input with shortcut (`/`), market status pulse, current date, and refresh action.\n   - **Market Ticker Strip**: Horizontally scrollable strip displaying **NIFTY 50**, **SENSEX**, **BANK NIFTY**, **S&P 500**, **NASDAQ Composite**, and **Dow Jones** with absolute points, percentage changes, movement indicators, smooth scroll controls, and clear **DEMO** badges.\n\n3. **Stock News Dashboard**:\n   - **Category Filters**: All News, Indian Markets, Global Markets, Stocks & Companies, Economy, Earnings, IPOs, Commodities, and Technology.\n   - **Secondary Controls**: Region filter (India, US, Global), Time Range (All, Today, This Week), and Sorting (Most Recent, Relevance).\n   - **Featured Story**: Hero card highlighting top stories with custom fallback financial terminal graphics.\n   - **News Feed**: Compact, high-density cards with publisher names, relative timestamps, sentiment tags, ticker chips (clickable to filter), pagination, empty state reset, and loading skeletons.\n   - **Trending Intelligence Panel**: Data-derived company mentions (e.g. $RELIANCE, $NVDA, $ZOMATO), popular market themes (Q3 Earnings, RBI Policy, AI Infrastructure), and key stories.\n   - **Article Details**: Modal with publisher metadata, full fair-use summaries, related equities, copyable links, and direct external links to original publishers.\n   - **Settings & API Modal**: Step-by-step instructions for adding free API keys in `.env`.\n\n---\n\n### Verification Summary\n- **Unit Tests**: 7/7 tests passed via `node:test` (`src/utils/newsFilters.test.ts`), verifying article deduplication, multi-criteria filtering, search relevance ranking, trending company extraction, and relative time formatting.\n- **Visual & Interactive Browser Verification**: Inspected across desktop (1440\303\227900) and mobile (390\303\227844) viewports. Verified modal interactions, search filtering, and fallback terminal graphics for offline image reliability.\n- **Compilation & Linting**: Clean TypeScript build (`compile_applet` and `lint_applet` passed with zero errors)."
